   "value": "test3 = Private`assignToGroups[{a, b, c, d}, {2, 2}];\ntest3Count = Length[test3];\ntest3Result = test3Count == 3;\nPrint[\"Test 3 (assignToGroups {2,2} count): \", test3Count, \" assignments - \", If[test3Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\nPrint[\"  Assignments: \", test3];\ntest3Result",
